#*: Equally so as it ha been in his own, over the estuous rivers of Lapland, or its frozen and '''cacuminous''' mountains;
#* {{quote-text|en|year=1871|author=Mortimer Collins|title=Inn Street Meetings|page=10|passage=Hours Of youth…and love ‛neath trees '''cacuminous'''.}}
